{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Calorya 是一款完全免費的卡路里與蛋白質追蹤工具，開啟即用，無需註冊帳戶，也沒有訂閱與廣告。它把飲食、體重、飲水、間歇性斷食與運動記錄整合在同一個介面，所有資料只留在你的 iPhone 與 iPad 上。若你不想被帳號與追蹤 SDK 打擾，卻希望認真管理每日熱量與營養，這款工具相當合用。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>飲食與體重一站記錄</h2>\n<p>App 內建全球食物資料庫，涵蓋各地菜式與連鎖餐廳菜單，可掃描條碼或選取最近記錄，蛋白質、碳水、脂肪與纖維按份量自動換算。體重趨勢圖設有目標線，並可讀寫 Apple Health。斷食計時支援 16:8、18:6、20:4 等預設，配合飲水記錄與一鍵運動預設，無需穿戴裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-241-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-242-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-243-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-244-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-245-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-246-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Calorie Tracker – Calorya</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T06:20:11.493370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}